      <div type="clause" n="2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IEw">I Ew</ref> 2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">[Be ðone ðe oþrum rihtes wyrnþ.] [Ld] Eac we cwædon, hwæs se wyrðe wære þe oðrum ryhtes wyrnde aðor oððe on boclande oððe on folclande; ⁊ ðæt he him geandágode of þam folclande, hwonne he him riht worhte beforan ðam gerefan.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Further, we have declared what [penalty] he is liable to, who withholds from another his rights either in 'bookland' or 'folcland'. And with regard to 'folcland' [we have declared] that he [the plaintiff] shall appoint a day when he [the defendant] shall do him justice in the presence of the reeve.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Eac we cwædon, hwæs se wyrðe wære ðe oðrum rihtes wyrnde aðor oððe on boclande oððe on folclande, hwonne he him riht worhte beforan ðam gerefan.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
